<section class="page-head">
  <div class="shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">Case study</p>
    <h1>What a thousand nurse calls actually looked like.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      PATON ran a pilot at the Geriatrische Klinik St.&nbsp;Gallen. For the first time, every call
      on the ward left a record — not just that a light went on, but what was asked for, which
      qualification it needed, and how far somebody walked to answer it.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

