<section class="section section--dark">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">What we learned</p>
      <h2>The log is the product.</h2>
      <p>
        The devices are the visible part, but the thing the ward could not get anywhere else was a
        record. Once a ward can see which requests it actually receives, which qualification each
        one needs, and what each response costs in walking, the conversation about staffing and
        layout stops being a matter of opinion.
      </p>
